<title>UK: Marine Tech prices $71.5 mln equity warrant bond.</title>
<headline>Marine Tech prices $71.5 mln equity warrant bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue has been priced, lead manager Tokyo-Mitsubishi International said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MARINE TECH LTD</p>
<p> AMT    $71.5 MLN     COUPON     2.625     MATURITY    18.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 WARRANTS  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25 PCT</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10    SALE LIMITS JP/US/UK/KY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.50     PRAECIPUUM  0.25</p>
<p> NOTES    - INIT SUBSCRIPTION PRICE 1,907 YEN PER SHARE</p>
<p>	    - 559,400 YEN SUBSCRIPTION PRICE PER WARRANT</p>
<p>	    - 293 SHARES PER WARRANT</p>
<p>	    - TWO WARRANTS PER BOND FOR ZUKEN INC SHARES</p>
<p>	    - FOREX RATE 111.88 YEN PER U.S. DOLLAR</p>
<p>	    - EXERCISE PERIOD   - 01.NOV.96-04.OCT.99</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
